Description:
    Generate benchmarks to compare performance optimizations.

Example:
    `bin/trails generate benchmark opt_compare`

    This will create:
        script/benchmarks/opt-compare.ts

    You can run the generated benchmark file using:
        `node script/benchmarks/opt-compare.ts`

    You can specify different reports:
        `bin/trails generate benchmark opt_compare patch1 patch2 patch3`
